# macOS Finder duplicate copies ("name 2.ext" beside the original) -
# local-only artifacts, never tracked (2026-10-29: 143 such copies,
# all byte-identical to their originals, untracked via git rm --cached).
# Matches a basename containing " 2."; contains no slash, so it applies
# at any depth and cannot cross directory boundaries.
* 2.*
